; The plugin declaration omits required `:name`; meta-validation
; rejects it (missing_required_key on the (plugin …) form). With no
; loaded plugin the schema is empty, so `(widget …)` resolves to
; nothing and the validator emits `unknown_form`.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code missing_required_key :path [plugin])
  (diagnostic :code unknown_form :path [widget]))
